    {
      "id": "note-s2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "✅ Each Kiali runs in its MCP namespace alongside istiod\n✅ kiali_urls enables cross-region navigation (click Cluster B in east → opens west Kiali)\n✅ Each instance has local Prometheus — no cross-region metric latency\n✅ Resilient: region failure doesn't affect the other Kiali",
