      "x": 80,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "✅ Combines Scenario 1 (multi-mesh per region) + Scenario 2 (cross-region linking)\n✅ Each Kiali uses control_plane_namespace_selector to scope to its region's MCPs\n✅ kiali_urls links east ↔ west for cross-region navigation\n✅ Scales to N regions × M meshes per region",
